sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Fresh as Fresh Device
    participant R as Nostr Relays
    participant S as Room Server
    participant Peers as Other Room Members

    User->>Fresh: Restore account identity key
    Fresh->>R: Fetch encrypted server manifest
    R-->>Fresh: Candidate server URLs
    Fresh->>S: Signed login and account lookup
    S-->>Fresh: Account known, but no active room state on this device
    Fresh->>Peers: Ask to be re-added as a new device
    Peers->>S: Submit add-member commits for recovered device
    S-->>Fresh: New welcomes and room logs from rejoin point
    Note over Fresh: Old room state and unbacked history are lost
